WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.011 --> 00:00:16.792
"Happy Halloween!" Aunt Judy said.

2
00:00:16.797 --> 00:00:20.686
"I have the best costume!" Harry said.

3
00:00:20.691 --> 00:00:24.479
"Cowboys get the most treats!"

4
00:00:24.484 --> 00:00:31.527
Emmy frowned. "Vampires get a lot of treats too."

5
00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:36.590
"So do ninjas," Oliver said.

6
00:00:36.595 --> 00:00:41.352
"You all have good costumes," Aunt Judy said.

7
00:00:41.357 --> 00:00:44.104
"I hope everyone gets lots of treats.

8
00:00:44.109 --> 00:00:48.313
And no tricks."

9
00:00:48.318 --> 00:00:56.696
Harry laughed. "No one will trick me!"

10
00:00:56.701 --> 00:01:00.351
"Hmm," Aunt Judy said.

11
00:01:00.356 --> 00:01:06.245
The kids went trick-or-treating.

12
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:14.907
They got lots of treats.

13
00:01:14.912 --> 00:01:19.266
"We can share," Emmy said.

14
00:01:19.271 --> 00:01:25.661
"No way," Harry said. "I'm not sharing!"

15
00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:30.293
The kids went home.

16
00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:34.832
Suddenly a witch jumped out from behind a tree.

17
00:01:34.837 --> 00:01:37.543
"Boo!" the witch yelled.

18
00:01:37.548 --> 00:01:41.675
The kids screamed.

19
00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:45.687
They dropped their treat bags and ran.

20
00:01:45.692 --> 00:01:59.300
The witch scooped up the bags.

21
00:01:59.305 --> 00:02:02.818
"Hey!" Oliver cried.

22
00:02:02.823 --> 00:02:07.302
"That's Aunt Judy!"

23
00:02:07.307 --> 00:02:11.384
Aunt Judy came over and took off her mask.

24
00:02:11.389 --> 00:02:17.504
She grinned. "It was a Halloween trick!

25
00:02:17.509 --> 00:02:22.524
Here are your treat bags."

26
00:02:22.529 --> 00:02:25.944
"Look at how many treats I got!" Harry said.

27
00:02:25.949 --> 00:02:29.918
He dumped out his bag.

28
00:02:29.923 --> 00:02:36.739
It was full of pinecones!

29
00:02:36.744 --> 00:02:42.390
"Hey! Where are my treats?" Harry cried.

30
00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:47.074
"Tricked you again!" Aunt Judy said.

31
00:02:47.079 --> 00:02:50.664
Aunt Judy gave Harry another bag.

32
00:02:50.669 --> 00:02:54.756
"I switched the bags.

33
00:02:54.761 --> 00:03:04.088
Here are your treats."

34
00:03:04.093 --> 00:03:09.050
"Let's share," Harry said.

35
00:03:09.055 --> 00:03:20.733
"Treats are better than tricks!"
